  "title": "Media Kit 2018 Eng",
  "to": "CIRCUIT DE BARCELONA-CATALUNYA On 11, 12 and 13 May, the Formula 1 World Championship will make its usual stop at Circuit de Barcelona-Catalunya in order to stage the fifth round of the calendar, the FORMULA 1 GRAN PREMIO DE ESPA\u00d1A EMIRATES 2018. The venue, a consolidated racetrack that is much appreciated by the premier class of motor sports, will be hosting the event for the 28th consecutive",
